SGSB v4.1 "MIDNIGHT TRAIN" QUICK REFERENCE GUIDE

Target Environment: American Truck Simulator (ATS)
Target Master File Path: /unit/hookup/animated_gate.sii
Compatibility: ATS Base Map, All State DLCs, & Major Map Combos (ProMods/Reforma)

Tollgates are controlled by tollgate.sii and gate_trigger.sii. Dynamic parking parameters manage rest area slot snapping, company yard alignment, and AI buffer clearance.

[CORE PARAMETER STANDARDS — GATES]

    High-Speed Approach Range (E-Tolls / Standard Open): 125.0m – 135.0m

    Stop-and-Go Range (Cash Toll Ramps): 20.0m

    Guard-Check / Security Range (Borders, Ports, Mines): 15.0m

    Bridge / Lock Gate Range: 25.0m

    Orientation Tolerance: 50° (Cash Tolls) to 90°–140° (Security & Standard)

    Audio Routing: /sound/world/gate_iron.soundref

[CORE PARAMETER STANDARDS — DYNAMIC PARKING]

    Rest Area / Truck Stop Snap Radius: 8.0m – 12.0m

    Company Prefab Loading Dock Buffer: 5.0m – 7.0m

    Weigh Station Parking Staging Range: 10.0m

    Orientation Alignment Tolerance: 15° – 30° (Precision Docking) / 45° (Pull-in Stalls)

    Parking Difficulty Integration: Synchronized with g_parking_difficulty [1–3]

